---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Kelvin Tse is a software developer and former vehicle dynamics professional writing about engineering, simulation and motorsport."
  canonical="/about/"
>
  <section class="page-header shell" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 id="about-heading">Kelvin Tse</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      Software developer and vehicle dynamics professional.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="page-body prose shell">
    <p>
      I'm Kelvin Tse. My background is in software development and systems
      engineering, with professional experience in the tech and automotive
      sectors. I am interested at the intersection of software, physical
      systems, and engineering.
    </p>

    <p>
      Vehicle dyanmics is one such interest. I am interested in how vehicle
      behaviour and driver experience can be understood through mathematical
      modelling, simulation and experimental analysis.
    </p>

    <p>
      My interest comes from connecting theory with real-world behaviour. I use
      this blog to document my investigations and share the underlying methods
      and findings, with the aim of making technical knowledge more accessible
      and open to discussion. 
    </p>

    <p>
      I am part of Formula Delta Performance Solutions, where we develop
      automotive performance components. For consulting, testing, and
      development inquiries, please contact us at <a
      href="https://formuladelta.ca">formuladelta.ca</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm also open to professional opportunities in software development,
      automotive, and multidisciplinary technical roles. Feel free to contact
      me directly.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
